#: scenario2:scenario2_E22FE049_A88F_43A9_8CD7_3982BE88FFB9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 687507ce15afb52cc214e327662d6c0a36d596235cb31a53673c87e45e376ece
#. default-sha256: 5a3b8de34b1f67f23293cd94f7e9aff32d57d39691058af41b1d0778537b0c6b
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_E22FE049_A88F_43A9_8CD7_3982BE88FFB9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Her once-porcelain skin was no longer even sickly pale; ⟪k:4⟫it was now the "
"bloodless color of dirt."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫도자기처럼 하얗던 소녀의 피부는 ⟪k:4⟫환자의 창백함조차 유지하질 못 했습니다. "
"⟪k:5⟫이미 혈색을 잃은 흙빛이었지요."

#: scenario2:scenario2_A1EC3F07_1EE7_43DF_A689_6A4096078902
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1ab440e507f13b3eb4f33c7a478d537dd65607a45690e6f01ca0185f33b17a63
#. default-sha256: f62a46a40f77f8d15a2a2a72674b7f8f25f10c9f4700cf0ba5c4e838f03a1801
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A1EC3F07_1EE7_43DF_A689_6A4096078902"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She was sprawled haphazardly out on the cellar floor, dried blood stains around her half-"
"open mouth."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫소녀는 사지를 무참히 늘어트린 채, ⟪k:1⟫벌어진 입에서 메마른 피를 토하고 있었습니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_32C72CC7_B3DD_449E_92AE_11F7B5E9653C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 811e52145bc977f0070915a567f287f8168d1d4b94ccbbbcdd4d7caf985f4f29
#. default-sha256: 3e8c2f30cab1d454c4cd0593ee755407119dc52561ce11fd21574790dfb03f00
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_32C72CC7_B3DD_449E_92AE_11F7B5E9653C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And those lips were, naturally, lacking their former rosen sheen."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫물론 그 입술도 ⟪k:1⟫익히 알던 장밋빛이 아니었습니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_80D20F98_39D0_487E_819C_2D75F6AF6F1E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fe7ad959a47e7b6a4efc37fcad843283bc82807a098019354e4256818795be01
#. default-sha256: 062a30002e3141cca2c376f375ed1d302b02b0407fe9378588418eecda413f20
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_80D20F98_39D0_487E_819C_2D75F6AF6F1E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Her body was covered with an array of wounds, but the most prominent was the man’s singular "
"sword standing tall in her chest."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫소녀의 몸에는 여러 상처가 나 있었는데, ⟪k:1⟫특히 눈에 띄던 것은 ⟪k:2⟫가슴팍에 꽂힌 그 기묘한 "
"검이었습니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_5497DD2B_7AA9_412F_A4C7_E956CC735A7F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0b9cae93e5fb8f662cf959b59ffe63eeb1b51efc508cd79e44082a1360004602
#. default-sha256: 5ba524ab14ab0cc394b74c15ce69621b8740bd13161ffa691ec816e11f81fb8a
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_5497DD2B_7AA9_412F_A4C7_E956CC735A7F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫This is the bestia? He doesn’t look like the same—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫이 놈이 베스티아……? ⟪k:1⟫마을을 공격한 놈이랑 똑같은 놈 같진 않은데……."

#: scenario2:scenario2_5ACD54F7_4991_4E63_8321_050CFE718B87
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9f59f3a62cbc3f6966a1e7b80372b55e10c5fb6a4625be233fc7ac46ffd1df9e
#. default-sha256: 4f778b5491dc5670af26bc9d0ef7a8f6acde373e40612fa170e743b1c89d836e
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_5ACD54F7_4991_4E63_8321_050CFE718B87"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It’s him."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫――――똑같아."

#: scenario2:scenario2_22974DDB_A02B_4355_9C19_87C8E4ABFF4A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 23336e73b51cbacc60456da33f069ab541f14e3bdcede442c20b1af588a04ea2
#. default-sha256: b1126b584fdd6393bf9c93de9f5f6bc943c7edbf3989f7a0586b81c4101dcb86
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_22974DDB_A02B_4355_9C19_87C8E4ABFF4A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫He’s the same guy. He’s the bestia."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫똑같아, ⟪k:6⟫저 놈이…… 베스티아야."

#: scenario2:scenario2_EC7EF1F2_30C9_4746_B008_846288EB85FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f9dc46dbae43ce0c9739c78c5c4857802258b144d66d3f2990e9aea3a85fe815
#. default-sha256: 90538024ccc26d33f755bd8e0344d07f22708f0a18b0217d367197fb77678e44
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_EC7EF1F2_30C9_4746_B008_846288EB85FD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫…………."

#: scenario2:scenario2_2DA8F6A6_502A_4DDE_9B3B_D7C0E7B63FA5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d7e6b0edc3ec06084fc2418b198d171233f215d69dbfd406280af0e741b3a240
#. default-sha256: 5507bc21b9b00e80d900408302d69207d72626f841367e10ad3470c0b55d3496
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_2DA8F6A6_502A_4DDE_9B3B_D7C0E7B63FA5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Several villagers surrounded him at the behest of a young boy."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫남자를 에워싼 것은 ⟪k:1⟫마을 사람 여럿. ⟪k:2⟫그 중심에는 ⟪k:3⟫소년이 있었습니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_1F6ADCD6_B6C7_4805_AEAE_56B4BD244EC2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1e456074bb4ae51127d7081161f7223742ce9adc08944f8081d8fa8886a379a6
#. default-sha256: ca7ca95b431e413d55f7e2caded2e79918cccdd351ccddb643cb8c24961b893e
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_1F6ADCD6_B6C7_4805_AEAE_56B4BD244EC2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫He’s gotten himself dressed up all proper and fancy,⟪k:2⟫but good clothes don’t make "
"him a good man."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫많이 그럴싸하게 꾸몄는데―― ⟪k:2⟫이 놈이 한 짓은 ⟪k:3⟫바뀌지 않았어."

#: scenario2:scenario2_C85DC6F6_8473_4869_81B2_C422794ABE0A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d06d0e533cfa6a723f8e1c038f433e1abe7b6dca744f163416a29617970c6ea9
#. default-sha256: 373da570d47448ea8de67a8fe2e2a4df1dc12a5ec3bc0ee1fc83b6a6255f2e2e
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_C85DC6F6_8473_4869_81B2_C422794ABE0A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Isn’t that right, you bestia? No—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫안 그러냐, 베스티아――, ⟪k:2⟫아니………!"

#: scenario2:scenario2_CE3B56D2_AF61_4FD8_ACCE_AAFA03899914
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5ad52c5ebcdea2e33c9b3e04e918faec91493d3dd82e0d07628a9976615caffa
#. default-sha256: 2753bdab233bc644100016f0a9f138470b47628033cb57192faf492f6411cfa8
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_CE3B56D2_AF61_4FD8_ACCE_AAFA03899914"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫YOU MURDERER!⟪k:7⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫………살인귀………!!!!"

#: scenario2:scenario2_D918FCA8_9DF1_47DC_BDC4_924974342DF1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 77d8ac165c8356ca2e496fa6324a0c3af0b8117f79acf888a757831d1ccc1c28
#. default-sha256: 71d395e76817792c9a207d4e78a82d8a998feaaf2d09df8e75f590c739cd9abe
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D918FCA8_9DF1_47DC_BDC4_924974342DF1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫...Ahh... ⟪k:4⟫aaAAaah... ⟪k:5⟫Wh-⟪k:6⟫Why, ⟪k:7⟫why, ⟪k:8⟫why did you kill "
"her? ⟪k:9⟫Why did you kill her? ⟪k:10⟫Why did you kill her? ⟪k:11⟫Why did you kill her? ⟪k:12⟫Why "
"did you kill her? ⟪k:13⟫Why did you kill her...?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫………아…… ⟪k:4⟫아아아…… ⟪k:5⟫왜, ⟪k:6⟫왜, ⟪k:7⟫왜, ⟪k:8⟫왜 죽였지, ⟪k:9⟫왜 죽였"
"지, ⟪k:10⟫왜 죽였지, ⟪k:11⟫왜 죽였지, ⟪k:12⟫왜 죽였지, ⟪k:13⟫왜 죽였지………."

#: scenario2:scenario2_2A3593DB_C85D_4EAB_AFB7_D6A7CB3B18E6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2a3689a11864e59c37ea3d901ede6913c00382e0f69ab08ae997c385c5600034
#. default-sha256: 0165a75b9b47c557d16d485e3903815b8abcd7b98772c84c6caf422529e9591b
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_2A3593DB_C85D_4EAB_AFB7_D6A7CB3B18E6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Why? You want to know why?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫왜……? ⟪k:3⟫왜⟪k:4⟫냐고……."

#: scenario2:scenario2_95FC6F93_3A9A_4F99_A283_82CCAE5AE001
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3b4f858ddbe4f53cc839fe064bb6afbd98378af6bcccb7a882112d1a67631b62
#. default-sha256: b8cf4627d5d783bc110f833f39aa9f6f75a246571f50144184847866d02bb28a
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_95FC6F93_3A9A_4F99_A283_82CCAE5AE001"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Her death was... ⟪k:1⟫an accident, I’d say."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그래――, ⟪k:1⟫이 사람은 「봉변」을 당한 거겠지."

#: scenario2:scenario2_15ECF27C_3298_4BFA_BD86_480B3E9C633A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 49f8521654bd9af651d3544dbd3ab4f89226c8797d9bc165caf7c297797f1cfb
#. default-sha256: 29a16ead342183107a385eed717464c153b4fe4c2429a0c4aa36afea37d6c85b
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_15ECF27C_3298_4BFA_BD86_480B3E9C633A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I feel bad about what happened."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫미안하다 싶어."

#: scenario2:scenario2_3BCCEC33_618B_4D5F_BF3A_4A5E83A9A78D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dedd86a12e75239a41e3e4a527ccaa4bb9c7cce3bc1e1823a2c0dc865d10f673
#. default-sha256: c22f18cfa0decdc1e8b393f0e68d16a6612e59a7c2690b6ca63214bedf5f9333
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_3BCCEC33_618B_4D5F_BF3A_4A5E83A9A78D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But any woman... ⟪k:1⟫who would live with a man like you..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하지만…… ⟪k:1⟫너 같은 놈이랑 같이 사는 여자면――"

#: scenario2:scenario2_4EDD06B9_F5AF_48D8_9E99_859BA071998D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d9e324b4ccbd7439b6e34a0b7575568439f5c64c1e73c353231095662a8d8b0d
#. default-sha256: 2f4c71c9a050e589366333c88483637fc00f48085fe83f279ad8e76cc2f4097b
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_4EDD06B9_F5AF_48D8_9E99_859BA071998D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫must be a witch."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫마녀일 거 아니야."

#: scenario2:scenario2_4708F244_1997_4422_807A_F3DC3A6953BE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c85bad288c9f79f6296f29ee61311cc8f057f1168485e247e40f0cf6eebde5df
#. default-sha256: f75d31f11665bed5bf2d231973a67632012626c86769d21542558e77ab62cb7a
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_4708F244_1997_4422_807A_F3DC3A6953BE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫…………!!!"

#: scenario2:scenario2_3A9C6FD3_2962_4EB1_96EA_17926D9282E8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4af465dcd0424036789ed19fa27f9ce8b63edca022acdf6f7822fadad86faf4e
#. default-sha256: bab8677d8e8f67f49104da26826f5cb88fba91f1189927a7c901dcbd8e5520c8
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_3A9C6FD3_2962_4EB1_96EA_17926D9282E8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Does that hurt?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Are you hurting right now, you bestia?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫마음 아파?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫야, ⟪k:5⟫네가 마음이 아프냐고, 베스티아……."

#: scenario2:scenario2_F04C05C9_C2EE_49B6_8A6C_8E8C07A104FC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aa56664d22ece825f4afb60511e95ae05c1323092d94327da8972551ffee7287
#. default-sha256: acc1cb9008351a926cfca8220010c7e4ac6b540a5fd448824064632e6f4b0ee0
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_F04C05C9_C2EE_49B6_8A6C_8E8C07A104FC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Then ⟪k:1⟫maybe now you understand⟪k:2⟫!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그럼――― ⟪k:1⟫이제 알겠냐!!"

#: scenario2:scenario2_58694139_F578_4104_93CC_37ECB8CDF07B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6d343938dc48f140cf24abb202ecaea66bb82ec8482e589b9e8748768f3a3644
#. default-sha256: d2075d4f6a1867fab55d0a3fc939454f782551ea1b1a9f5ec0543aee52b9dbfd
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_58694139_F578_4104_93CC_37ECB8CDF07B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You— ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You not only stole my parents and friends from me..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫넌――, ⟪k:1⟫나한테서 부모랑 친구를 빼앗은 데 더해――"

#: scenario2:scenario2_585A8BB1_958A_4418_898D_3E09A94AD199
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c99ee1f96457d4f9d840fbfaae239822faa4238827a3035959c02a69b61c1623
#. default-sha256: cfea90376ec080b4e44b5d6448c82f9476d1ae3b01639c58688fdd09e5b55008
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_585A8BB1_958A_4418_898D_3E09A94AD199"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫you ⟪k:1⟫ripped⟪k:2⟫ the last shard of hope I had from my hands!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫마지막 희망까지 빼앗았어……!!"

#: scenario2:scenario2_BC12F9A1_5EF3_4F36_8B21_34156C856F89
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8a7a538199f94ce11472f97c1a5d7e85b3c147744a8190413093697693a20556
