msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_02B49B30_EFEA_4C88_9818_03811106B3FD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Believing he’d had everything taken from him and could not possibly lose anything more was, "
"I imagine, what had allowed him to stand up to the beast—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫the source of such crippling "
"fear."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫모든 걸 잃은 소년. ⟪k:1⟫더 잃을 게 없다고 판단하여 ⟪k:2⟫그토록 두려워하던 짐승과 맞서기로 했"
"을 겁니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_17FD780A_3AAC_447B_87B0_D894F745A28E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 58ff71980713e1b8e334802070be1134a7d808145ee254d6147f50d4569765ab
