msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_17FD780A_3AAC_447B_87B0_D894F745A28E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Yet now, he found himself unable to move. ⟪k:1⟫He found himself, in the face of such an "
"incomprehensible creature, paralyzed with fear."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그런데도 ⟪k:1⟫소년은 꼼짝도 못 했습니다. ⟪k:2⟫눈앞에 있는―― 이해가 못 미치는 상대에게 ⟪k:3⟫참"
"기 힘든 공포를 느꼈지요."

