msgid "⟪k:0⟫You always bore those twisted desires."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫당신은 오랫동안 ⟪k:1⟫일그러진 욕망을 품고 살았을 겁니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_BBE87457_07C0_4483_A0F1_BF17269574BD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 33960401a7f081bf1a649d5c5dd173c6bc1fe943c9db859e1aef3575ac312cc0
