msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_F4E49F3B_D9CA_427E_B899_1389FEB24806"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You ⟪k:1⟫wanted⟪k:2⟫ to be a brutal, savage murderer."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫살인 짐승으로 있길 바란 건 ⟪k:1⟫바로 당신이었지요……?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_C0DB59C0_7113_42D1_8D06_E35BA1B5A873
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7b8598fa95ce127424aa6f3188d6874627daa9e03abf34acddb8278f55fb78db
#. default-sha256: 260de42d9fdc9b4c6878df448709f82987e191c795ccb70c165115d0b3146c56
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_C0DB59C0_7113_42D1_8D06_E35BA1B5A873"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You never really ⟪k:1⟫loved⟪k:2⟫ the White-Haired Girl—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫or the black-haired woman, "
"for that matter. ⟪k:5⟫You were merely attached to them."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫당신은―― 백발 소녀와 ⟪k:1⟫흑발 여성을 ⟪k:2⟫사랑하지 않았을 테지요. ⟪k:3⟫당신 안에 있던 건 강"
"한 집착 뿐."

#: scenario2:scenario2_2F776632_2AC1_49D6_88BF_680B9BAC172E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1d1b4575baa68723b936fd375a2a58976eb89807e105381ca9e9d9a5122f8405
#. default-sha256: 2d0cd64b65d5b4309213c46dadb3a5f1614e49b1ffdd5838234a538cbccc180f
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_2F776632_2AC1_49D6_88BF_680B9BAC172E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Fixated on the idea of a world of tranquility."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫평온한 세계에 품는 ⟪k:1⟫집착."

#: scenario2:scenario2_A1664B25_FF83_4E44_A27A_85AAC594E212
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9c37044d5d3b12bc77ccc1beecd4e90f9967cb8710cc4c0851a550d59329f938
#. default-sha256: b4384a359cafc54e8f4efeb2730381a461add1d1b92912aeb4cf4d8149cee515
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A1664B25_FF83_4E44_A27A_85AAC594E212"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You used this peace to anchor yourself, to prevent you from drifting off into the ocean of "
"your desires. ⟪k:1⟫You yearned to cause pain..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫당신은 욕망에 넘어가려는 자신의 마음을 ⟪k:1⟫평온으로 매어 두려 했습니다. ⟪k:2⟫당신은 남을 해"
"치고 싶어 하면서도――"

#: scenario2:scenario2_8B794FBB_C1CB_483B_A730_3ABA2ECE022E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a004592f4bd1afe244a94f223ab6a37be128b24f7222dcae501cc528ef10afc6
#. default-sha256: bc7278acb50b6bb5cbfce260b0c61286080a5ecb569fcd267e2556ad8add837c
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_8B794FBB_C1CB_483B_A730_3ABA2ECE022E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫while also hungering for the opposite—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫a calm life."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫이와 상반되는 평화로운 일상도 갈망했을 겁니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_3152E2D5_15AB_4D42_B0D0_393AF5D0C640
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b314c39defedd5d65ce5e9b5f9547d7b0a24635e31271ec73e3e93b281d11644
#. default-sha256: 9d74618c69cccc8d278e9c561bbcb7fa43ca6ea17260cfff04932d3545e51d2c
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_3152E2D5_15AB_4D42_B0D0_393AF5D0C640"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You idolized this idealized life, spent in quiet harmony with another, because you knew just "
"how difficult it would be for you to attain."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫평온한 이와 함께 보는 세계를―― 소망했지요? ⟪k:1⟫그게 본인이 ⟪k:2⟫얼마나 얻기 힘든 것인지 진심"
"으로 이해했기에."

#: scenario2:scenario2_7F114237_89C5_4533_98C4_528D99C82EE7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7fd62e1f69c70fdae5c643692a4ccede7cd3ccc3476faab52fc040b569634d2f
#. default-sha256: 6dadb3bc57ec75fd492bf827728887e2fe1ef34acea534014afe231bce42b49c
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_7F114237_89C5_4533_98C4_528D99C82EE7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Far more difficult for you than satisfying your cravings—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫but not impossible."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫당신에게는 욕망에 빠지는 것보다 ⟪k:1⟫험난한 길이었을 겁니다. ⟪k:2⟫하지만 ⟪k:3⟫마냥 불가능한 "
"것도 아니지 않았을지요?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_35DF5C94_9240_4038_B519_C29D0C6FFB68
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1e9b3a20a88eacc02967aa14e8440be37aabe3701577213a31c88464ba00b433
#. default-sha256: e301b850fc59357dae591b4bff8504136906476b2fb68b02479384f5ee3a8965
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_35DF5C94_9240_4038_B519_C29D0C6FFB68"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I, personally, had hoped you would find peace with someone rather than descend into savagery."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫저는 ⟪k:1⟫당신이 짐승으로 전락하는 길보다는―― ⟪k:2⟫누군가와 평온하게 사는 길을 바랐답니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_2DDE1EA6_53AD_4419_8B34_EA7E06C24F79
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a3c53ad388ddb04fe94c6ccc4494773bae691daff03f172cfc42b759d809ecde
#. default-sha256: 3957bd9f9e9be9e0ac83c19f1c43af57786837504aa1e4f01619ce3cd5798fb0
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_2DDE1EA6_53AD_4419_8B34_EA7E06C24F79"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It may have only been superficial...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫but it would have been very human."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그게 비록 ⟪k:1⟫가면을 써야만 성립되는 것일지라도…… ⟪k:2⟫훨씬 인간적이지 않겠는지요."

#: scenario2:scenario2_A94EA007_E8EB_41A7_8D34_81E107BB89BB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7729d5e2b67afe07fa554783d206386bd190d38cd68506085899b86ed38897e8
#. default-sha256: e0f14388d1e73a580f53afca4af149a6030966ff41553ec1d8c7a55e61e64b12
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A94EA007_E8EB_41A7_8D34_81E107BB89BB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But ultimately, peace slipped through your fingers..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하지만 결국…… ⟪k:1⟫당신의 평온은 사라졌고――"

#: scenario2:scenario2_86C1D961_1270_428E_9173_02F4CA02C9FC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c97e3ac7c664a0714946888c509f0b944821c47c6ee044f24a05d96637e38a61
#. default-sha256: 2254d8dbf78fdc4018546685c47b57fe7c13111cb7eed88b33a8057d67c70525
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_86C1D961_1270_428E_9173_02F4CA02C9FC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫and no one was left to suppress your desires. ⟪k:1⟫You cannot, after all, hold them back "
"yourself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그 욕망을 멈출 이는 ⟪k:1⟫남지 않았습니다. ⟪k:2⟫당신 혼자서는 ⟪k:3⟫멈출 방도가 없으니 말이지"
"요?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_03D04C05_B7DF_4E7B_A9FB_9B8158470996
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f424259fe123a2d32e470d0354f49024a45c0ce270325cb26ec591fe8b5cf477
